OL,3,GNEWSAVicar banned for coercive control
OL,4,Aand affair
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent vicar has been banned from the
OL,7,Fministry for life after a Church of
OL,8,FEngland tribunal found he had
OL,9,Fcoercively controlled his former wife
OL,10,Fand had a relationship with a
OL,11,Fvulnerable parishioner.
OL,13,FReverend Dr Johnny Douglas was
OL,14,Fsuspended from his position as vicar of
OL,15,FSt Paul's Swanley in 2024 following
OL,16,Fcomplaints that were referred into the
OL,17,FChurch of England's formal clergy
OL,18,Fdiscipline process, the Diocese of
OL,19,FRochester said.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
